 "name_en": "Asset Accounting – Group Ledger IFRS (UPA) (6DS)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Asset Accounting – Group Ledger IFRS (UPA) (6DS)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Asset accounting is a subsidiary ledger of the general ledger and is used to manage and document fixed asset transactions in detail. In general ledger accounting, can update depreciation and changes to asset balance sheet values in asset accounting. You can also make various account assignments to cost accounting for these transactions. Because of the integration in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>, Asset Accounting (FI-AA) transfers data directly to and from other <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> components like Financial Accounting (FI) components.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Ledger-specific transactions and reports support analysis of depreciation and asset balance to fulfill different accounting principle, such as Asset Revaluation, Depreciation Reporting, Manage Depreciation Runs, Asset Balance, and Asset Total Depreciation.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item is for IFRS.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create asset submaster</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Valuate assets</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform month-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform year-end closing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Support IFRS accounting principles</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate values for depreciation in parallel ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze asset balance for various depreciation areas</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable ordinary revaluation in general for IFRS</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>资产会计 – 集团分类账 IFRS (UPA) (6DS)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">资产会计是总账的明细分类账，用于管理和详细记录固定资产交易。在总账会计中，可以在资产会计中更新折旧和对资产负债表值的更改。您还可以为这些交易向成本会计进行各种科目分配。由于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的集成，资产会计 (FI-AA) 直接与其他 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 组件（如财务会计 (FI) 组件）传输数据。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">分类账特定的事务和报表支持折旧和资产余额的分析以满足不同的会计准则，例如资产重估、折旧报表、管理折旧运行、资产余额和资产总折旧。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目适用于 IFRS。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建资产子主数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">评估资产</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行月末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行年终关账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio89c2543e1cae4a96aeee99a2def8ee7f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">支持 IFRS 会计准则</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在并行分类账中计算折旧值</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析不同折旧范围的资产余额</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为 IFRS 启用常规普通重估</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
